  <data name="Nav_About_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Mirror and control a HarmonyOS phone on your PC in real time over hdc wireless debugging.
A self-hosted Windows desktop client: nothing is installed on the phone, only the built-in hdc wireless debugging is used.
Supports HarmonyOS NEXT 5.0.0 (API 12) and above; verified on OpenHarmony 7.0.0.111 (API 26).
Video comes from the on-device casting service, input goes through uitest uiInput, audio goes over Bluetooth A2DP - the PC drives all of it.</value>
  </data>
